### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 场景 5: 多轮对话 - 上下文理解
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5.1 第一轮：查询订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "查询最近的订单",
  "enableFunctions": true
}

> {%
    // 保存 sessionId 用于后续对话
    client.global.set("sessionId", response.body.sessionId);
    client.log("Session ID: " + response.body.sessionId);
%}

### 5.2 第二轮：追加条件（测试上下文）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "只要今天的",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "enableFunctions": true
}

### 5.3 第三轮：继续追问
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "其中有多少是已完成的？",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "enableFunctions": true
}

