### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 11.1 清除指定会话
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/ai/session/{{sessionId}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 场景 12: 完整业务流程模拟
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 12.1 步骤1 - 查询订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "查询最近一周的订单统计",
  "enableFunctions": true
}

> {%
    client.global.set("flowSessionId", response.body.sessionId);
%}

### 12.2 步骤2 - 追加条件
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "其中有多少是已完成的？",
  "sessionId": "{{flowSessionId}}",
  "enableFunctions": true
}

### 12.3 步骤3 - 分析数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "和上周相比增长了多少？",
  "sessionId": "{{flowSessionId}}",
  "enableFunctions": true
}

### 12.4 步骤4 - 总结
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我总结一下整体情况",
  "sessionId": "{{flowSessionId}}",
  "enableFunctions": false
}

